Hello,
thanks for the feedback on how to put r-squared values from different 
regressions into a table (S. Smith, B. Venables, D. McKenzie, C. 
Gooddall). The one that did exactly what I wanted was the following 
solution from Colin Gooddall (and others):

rsq <- numeric(15)
rsq[1] <- summary( lm1 <- lm( x1 ~ y1) )$r.squared
rsq[2] <- summary( lm2 <- lm( x2 ~ y2) )$r.squared
...
rsq[15] <- summary( lm15 <- lm( x15 ~ y15) )$r.squared
names(rsq) <- "vector.of.descriptive.names"

Thanks and best regards
   Falk

