>>> The first model that i estimated is a random intercept model, i used the
>>> following code to estimate it.
>>>          lme(fixed=resp~sex+time*sex,
>>>             random=~1,
>>>             cluster=~idnr,
>>>             est.method=c("ML"),  
>>>             data=Gro2)
