From bates at stat.wisc.edu  Fri Jan 29 18:46:45 1999
From: bates at stat.wisc.edu (Douglas Bates)
Date: Fri, 29 Jan 1999 12:46:45 -0600
Subject: Re: [S] condensing a dataframe sequentially
References: <s6b1af73.079@IGSRN008.er.usgs.gov>
